# Chat Surface -> Repo Routing (Hard Stop)

- Before any `ghost_chatui` or operator chat edits, confirm the served route in `Caddyfile` and map it to the source repo.
- If URL is `https://ghoststack.rideai.com.au/ghost_chatui/`, edit `/var/Ghost-chatUI` first; do not default to `ghoststack-rag/ui`.
- If URL/surface is the GhostDASH app root (non-`ghost_chatui`), edit `ghoststack-rag/ui`.
- Do not implement changes until this mapping check is complete.
- If uncertain, stop and run one verification command, then proceed only after the mapping is explicit.

## Required parity behavior

- When a fix affects shared voice/chat behavior, sweep both codebases:
  - `ghoststack-rag/ui`
  - `/var/Ghost-chatUI`
- Report parity status explicitly: `both`, `ghoststack-rag/ui only`, or `/var/Ghost-chatUI only`.
